comment0.text=\r\n\ A\ class\ representing\ the\ bicomplex\ function\ that\ creates\ polynomials\ \r\n\ P(z)\ \=\ sum_(j<n)\ c_j*z^j\r\n\ with\ coefficients\ c_j\ an\ array\ of\ bicomplex\ numbers\r\n
